      "description": "2cubes为长沙第二届小草艺术节·碟蝶不休设计了主视觉及招募海报。飞碟营地曾是一座旧军工厂，承载着一代人的集体记忆与青春热血；如今，它成为新艺术家自由表达的创作现场。 两种时代精神在此交汇碰撞，“不休”不止。「碟」：源自飞碟营地，喻指军工厂冷硬的精密零件，也隐喻那个封闭而未知的过去时代。「蝶」：象征艺术与蜕变，如蝴蝶破茧，为这片工业遗址带来柔软而坚韧的新生命。",
      "descriptionEn": "2cubes designed the key visual and recruitment posters for the 2nd Little Grass Art Festival - Never Ending in Changsha. UFO Camp was once an old military factory, carrying the collective memory and passion of a generation; today, it has become a creative field for new artists to express freely. Two spirits of different eras converge and collide here, never ending. 'UFO/Plate': originating from the UFO Camp, it represents the cold, precise parts of the military factory, and also metaphors the closed and unknown past. 'Butterfly': symbolizing art and metamorphosis, like a butterfly emerging from its cocoon, bringing soft yet resilient new life to this industrial heritage.",
